WEBVTT

1
00:00:00.437 --> 00:00:04.350
Unit eighteen. Intro to 3D Printing!

2
00:00:05.278 --> 00:00:10.197
Hello, everyone! I'm Ms. Emily, your technology teacher.

3
00:00:10.247 --> 00:00:13.979
Hi, Ms. Emily! What do we learn today?

4
00:00:14.029 --> 00:00:18.274
Today we learn about Intro to 3D Printing. Let's go!

5
00:00:19.348 --> 00:00:24.665
3D printing. Say it with me. 3D printing!

6
00:00:28.178 --> 00:00:31.927
Model. Say it with me. Model!

7
00:00:35.414 --> 00:00:39.014
Layer. Say it with me. Layer!

8
00:00:42.506 --> 00:00:47.740
Design software. Say it with me. Design software!

9
00:00:51.241 --> 00:00:55.241
Material. Say it with me. Material!

10
00:00:58.730 --> 00:01:02.421
Print. Say it with me. Print!

11
00:01:05.916 --> 00:01:10.548
Physical object. Say it with me. Physical object!

12
00:01:14.053 --> 00:01:18.803
Digital blueprint. Say it with me. Digital blueprint!

13
00:01:22.290 --> 00:01:32.603
3D printing turns a digital blueprint, made in design software, into a physical object. A printer builds a model layer by layer using material.

14
00:01:32.653 --> 00:01:36.507
Now I understand. Thank you, Ms. Emily!

15
00:01:37.542 --> 00:01:43.090
Look! What's the word?

16
00:01:43.140 --> 00:01:44.290
Layer!

17
00:01:45.302 --> 00:01:50.746
Look! What's the word?

18
00:01:50.796 --> 00:01:52.401
Physical object!

19
00:01:53.466 --> 00:02:03.249
Did you know? 3D printers have been used to create everything from toys to actual working parts for machines and even human tissue research!

20
00:02:03.299 --> 00:02:05.682
Wow! I did not know that!

21
00:02:06.579 --> 00:02:16.182
Think and answer. What is something you would like to create using a 3D printer?

22
00:02:16.232 --> 00:02:17.382
Great answer!

23
00:02:18.475 --> 00:02:24.046
Great job today! Keep learning, and see you next time. Goodbye!

24
00:02:24.096 --> 00:02:27.412
Goodbye, everyone! See you next time!

